    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Questions frequently test the distinction between different sand dune types based on wind direction and sand availability.",
        "Barchans, transverse dunes, longitudinal dunes (seifs), and parabolic dunes are high-yield topics in Geography prelims and mains."
      ],
      "id": "gcgfic2"
